        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.filmogaz.com/118959" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Clawdbot 详细报道（Filmogaz）</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://eu.36kr.com/en/p/3656002519228805" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Clawdbot 分析（36 氪）</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://medium.com/@gemQueenx/clawdbot-ai-the-revolutionary-open-source-personal-assistant-transforming-productivity-in-2026-6ec5fdb3084f" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Clawdbot: The Revolutionary Open-Source Personal Assistant（Medium）</a>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="ref-group">市场与趋势</h3>
      <ul class="ref-list">
        <li>
          <a href="https://fortune.com/2025/05/07/prompt-engineering-200k-six-figure-role-now-obsolete-thanks-to-ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Prompt Engineering: 200K Six-Figure Role Now Obsolete（Fortune）</a>
          <span>2025.05.07</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/why-cloudflare-is-surging-clawdbot-ai-agents-and-the-future-of-edge-computing-4465853" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare Surge Analysis — Clawdbot, AI Agents and the Future of Edge Computing</a>
        </li>
